1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,552
Now turn the law into an equation.

2
00:00:02,552 --> 00:00:12,265
Normality is equivalents per litre, so in V cubic centimetres of a solution of normality N, there are N times V milliequivalents.

3
00:00:12,265 --> 00:00:16,770
At the end point, the milliequivalents of the two reactants are equal.

